# React / TSX (PLOS `src`)

## Styling

- Prefer **Tailwind CSS 4** utility classes over hand-written CSS.
- Global tokens live in `src/styles/main.css`（`:root` 语义值 + `@theme inline`：PLOS 语义 `app-bg` `surface` `subtle` `line` `ink-1..3` `primary` `state-*`，以及 shadcn 角色桥接 `background/card/foreground/muted/accent/border/ring/…`）。Reuse those tokens（`bg-surface`, `text-ink-2`, `bg-primary`, …）; avoid scattering new hex values. 映射见 `docs/ui-component-system-shadcn-design-2026-09.md` §5.3。
- Reuse `src/components/ui/*`（**UI Kit**，shadcn/ui 风格、Base UI 底层、代码入库自有）与 `src/components/primitives.tsx`（`Section`、`KnowledgeRow`、`EvidenceRow`、`ActionCard`、`Card`、`Stat`、`DeltaBadge`）以及 `src/components/layout/AppShell.tsx`（`PageContainer`）before inventing new atoms.
- State semantic colors (mastered/learning/weak/idle/failed) apply to **dot/badges only**, not full backgrounds.

## Component policy（组件来源优先级）

1. 先查 `src/components/ui/*` 是否有现成控件（button/input/dialog/…）；有则直接 import `@/components/ui/xxx` 或用相对导入。
2. 缺失的受控交互组件（浮层/菜单/弹窗/键盘导航类）：优先按 shadcn 惯例自建进 `ui/`（`cva` + 语义 token + `data-slot` + React 19 无 forwardRef），**不得**在业务代码里用原生 `<select>` / `window.confirm` 等绕过。
3. **不引入** antd、Radix UI、MUI、Emotion、styled-components、ahooks。Base UI（`@base-ui/react`）由 `ui/` 层封装后供上层使用，业务代码不直接 import。
4. 领域组合语义（卡、行、徽标）仍走 `primitives.tsx` / feature 组件。

## Language

- **Talk to the user in 中文.**
- **Comments:** follow the file (repo defaults to 中文注释).
- **User-facing copy:** always via `src/i18n` (`useI18n`, `messages/zh.ts` + `messages/en.ts` pairs) — never hardcode. `components/ui/*` 是纯展示控件，不含文案；文案由调用方传入。

## Tooling

- Do not add demo pages or extra README files unless the user asks.
- Prefer existing stores/hooks (`src/stores/*`, feature hooks) over new global state.
- Keep files ≤ 700 lines; split by responsibility.
- 新增/改动 UI 前先过 `skills/ui-impl-tokens/SKILL.md`。

